 additional rain will result in minor\nflooding.\n\n- Some locations that will experience flooding include...\nHighlands Ranch, Littleton, Roxborough Park, Louviers, Chatfield\nReservoir, Sprucewood, Kassler and Columbine.","ends":"2026-08-22T18:30:00-06:00","severity":"Minor","areaDesc":"Arapahoe, CO; Douglas, CO; Jefferson, CO","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.79babdd62d6ef165ae91cdad79407999210da5fc.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.79babdd62d6ef165ae91cdad79407999210da5fc.001.1"}],"afd":{"office":"BOU","issued":"2026-08-22T23:47:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FXUS65 KBOU 222347 AFDBOU Area Forecast Discussion National Weather Service Denver/Boulder CO 547 PM MDT Sat Aug 22 2026 FXUS65 KBOU 221850 AFDBOU Area Forecast Discussion National Weather Service Denver/Boulder CO 1250 PM MDT Sat Aug 22 2026 - Highest coverage of showers and storms expected today, along with a few severe storms and locally heavy rainfall this afternoon and evening. - Scattere","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=BOU&issuedby=BOU&product=AFD&format=CI"},"hwo":null,"fwf":{"office":"BOU","issued":"2026-08-22T19:27:00+00:00","snippet":".DISCUSSION...Rest of today through Sunday... Scattered to numerous showers and storms, most with wetting rains, will push east from the mountains across the plains late this afternoon and evening. Humidity values will be moderate today, and then expect very good recovery tonight in all areas. Sunday will feature scattered afternoon and evening storm coverage, with just a slight decrease in wettin","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=BOU&issuedby=BOU&product=FWF&format=CI"},"coagmet":{"station_id":"ccr01","station_name":"Cherry Creek Reservoir","distance_km":26.1,"soil_temp_5cm_f":85.86,"soil_temp_15cm_f":85.91,"soil_moisture_5cm":null,"soil_moisture_15cm":null,"precip_in":null,"eto_in":null,"vapor_pressure":null,"solar_radiation":83.15,"wind_speed_mph":4.29,"air_temp_f":75.69,"relative_humidity":0.489,"u